"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[9578],{19578:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"bessent-khe-lifen-peregovory-tramp-si","locale":"en","title":"Bessent and He Lifeng hold New York talks 4 days before the Trump–Xi meeting","description":"US Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent met Chinese Vice Premier He Lifeng in New York on Sunday ahead of Trump and Xi’s Thursday meeting. Extending the trade truce between the two largest economies is at stake; for Russia, the issue is oil demand.","blocks":[{"id":"b001","kind":"paragraph","text":"Bessent wrote on X that he and He Lifeng were “continuing discussions on US–China economic and trade relations” ahead of Trump and Xi\'s “historic meeting” in Washington, posting an official photograph in front of flags. He gave no further details. Later, he called the talks successful and said the sides focused on trade and artificial intelligence. Xinhua confirmed the meeting. The presidents themselves are to meet on Thursday, September 24."},{"id":"b002","kind":"paragraph","text":"Previews identify the agenda: tariffs, AI competition, semiconductor export controls and possible Chinese electric-vehicle production in the US, with Taiwan and Iran in the background. Relations have deteriorated since the leaders\' May meeting: American officials publicly accuse China of failing to honour the year-long trade truce. Chinese restrictions on exports of critical minerals and rare earths also hang over the meeting, having already disrupted American and other manufacturers."},{"id":"b003","kind":"paragraph","text":"The trade truce itself is straightforward. A year ago, the sides agreed not to raise tariffs on each other or introduce new restrictions. It is a pause in an argument with an expiry date: agree not to fight, then decide whether to extend the pause. The deadline is approaching, which is Thursday\'s main uncertainty. The issue is not necessarily whether a major agreement is signed, but whether nothing is signed at all. The truce would then expire and both sides would again be free to change tariffs."},{"id":"b004","kind":"paragraph","text":"Rare earths provide leverage in these negotiations. Electronics, batteries and weapons need them, while Chinese exports are restricted. Imagine a car plant with only one supplier for a component: the supplier dictates price and delivery, and the plant cannot assemble a car without it. That makes disruption more damaging than tariffs. A tariff makes a part more expensive; without delivery, the part is simply unavailable."},{"id":"b005","kind":"paragraph","text":"Markets are waiting rather than placing strong bets. US index futures edged higher on Monday, while the dollar stayed within a narrow range. Nobody wants to guess the outcome. Thursday\'s conclusion is unknown, and both leaders know how to signal readiness either to agree or walk away until the last moment."},{"id":"b006","kind":"paragraph","text":"There is no direct Russian channel: none of the agenda concerns Russian imports or the ruble. The transmission is longer. If the US and China raise tariffs again, global trade slows, followed by oil demand. Oil supports Russia\'s budget revenue and exchange rate. If they agree, that source of pressure on oil disappears. There is no estimate of its magnitude."},{"id":"b007","kind":"paragraph","text":"For an ordinary person, this is news to monitor rather than act on alone. Buying currency “just in case before the summit” means paying the bank\'s spread for an event that has not happened. But treating major-country trade wars as irrelevant to Russia also fails: they reach the budget and exchange rate through oil prices, often with a delay of months."}],"sources":[{"label":"https://www.interfax.ru/world/1117310","url":"https://www.interfax.ru/world/1117310"},{"label":"https://finance.yahoo.com/economy/policy/articles/trump-xi-showdown-casts-shadow-200000957.html","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/economy/policy/articles/trump-xi-showdown-casts-shadow-200000957.html"},{"label":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-09-21/trump-xi-to-meet-amidst-friction-on-wars-tech-trade-video","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-09-21/trump-xi-to-meet-amidst-friction-on-wars-tech-trade-video"},{"label":"https://www.reuters.com/business/finance/us-treasurys-bessent-chinas-he-launch-talks-on-ai-trade-critical-minerals-2026-09-20","url":"https://www.reuters.com/business/finance/us-treasurys-bessent-chinas-he-launch-talks-on-ai-trade-critical-minerals-2026-09-20"},{"label":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-20/us-stock-futures-up-ahead-of-talks-dollar-steady-markets-wrap","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-20/us-stock-futures-up-ahead-of-talks-dollar-steady-markets-wrap"}],"sourceBodySha256":"c1bc79749a4e70a8e26a07aaaf0de06d665d61f9e8ea4735408da5f270991985"}')}}]);